<title>RUSSIA: Russian March wage arrears rise to 11.31 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Russian March wage arrears rise to 11.31 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian wage arrears rose to 11.31 trillion roubles in March from 10.33 trillion roubles in February, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p> RUSSIAN WAGE ARREARS		Mar 24	 Feb 24</p>
<p> wage arrears (government)	 11,305	 10,334</p>
<p> wage arrears (companies)	  41,346	 39,902</p>
<p> wage arrears (total)		52,669	 50,236</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in billions of roubles. ($1 = 5,746 roubles)</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
